{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 50, :comments ["<b>And we brought near.</b> In thought or in speech." "<b>Armlet.</b> It is on the arm, for so it is written." "<b>And bracelet.</b> For the hand." "<b>Ring.</b> On the finger." "<b>Earring.</b> In the ears, for so it is written. Perhaps it is called thus because it is round." "<b>And kumaz.</b> Like its companions."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:03.103420312Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}